   1++6E42              ; =========================================================================
   2++6E42              ; PROJECT126 — ATM-side TR-DOS directory browser
   3++6E42              ; Reads the native TR-DOS catalogue and allows cursor navigation.
   4++6E42              ; The directory is read from track 0 into the page-0 buffer at #C800.
   5++6E42              ; =========================================================================
   6++6E42
